# Mana value is the mana cost's alone, whatever is paid instead (CR 202.3; Gaddock Teeg's ruling): Echo of Eons, mana
# value 6, may not be cast for its flashback cost of {2}{U} under Gaddock Teeg (CR 702.34a), though Bot1 has five mana to
# pay it. Lingering Souls, mana value 3, may be: Bot1 casts it from its hand and then from its graveyard for its flashback
# cost, {1}{B}. Bot2's Duress put Echo of Eons into Bot1's graveyard on turn 2.

